               <head>March 12, 1909</head>
               <p>Friday</p>
               <figure>
                  <graphic url="IMG_2050.jpg"></graphic>
               </figure>
               <p>Molly on snowshoes that Mr. Weir got.
                  Pretty picture is it not?!</p>
