            <div n="2" type="calendar-page">
               <head>March 17, 1909</head>
               <p>Wednesday</p>
               <figure>
                  <graphic url="IMG_2052.jpg"></graphic>
               </figure>
               <p>St. Patrick was a useful saint. 
                  He frightend all the snakes away- 
                  I wish he'd try his art on smoke around the Hammermill someday</p>
            </div>
